{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's a simple puzzle game about placing iceberg tiles on hexagonal sea tiles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Click on an iceberg to freely place it on the sea, but make sure to keep the icebergs apart from each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">60+ Levels </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game offers 60+ handcrafted levels </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A variety of animals and mechanics make the puzzles engaging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adorable Animals</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet cute polar bears, penguins, walruses, and orcas. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Place the same animals within one tile of each other, but avoid placing them near the orcas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Simple Controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game only requires clicking the left and right mouse buttons. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's easy for anyone to pick up, from beginners of all ages to seasoned puzzle enthusiasts.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3193980?t=1742185051","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3193980?t=1742185051","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193980/01475cab96508f1327c6f09a860e3c04ebe939a8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742185051","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3193980/01475cab96508f1327c6f09a860e3c04ebe939a8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742185051","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3194060,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's a simple puzzle game about placing iceberg tiles on hexagonal sea tiles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Click on an iceberg to freely place i